Grammar

    0 $accept: expr $end

    1 expr: ID
    2      | expr `+` ID
    3      | IF expr THEN expr
    4      | IF expr THEN expr ELSE expr


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    IF (258) 3 4
