State 0

    0 $accept: • expr $end

    IF  shift, and go to state 1
    ID  shift, and go to state 2

    expr  go to state 3


State 1

    3 expr: IF • expr THEN expr
    4      | IF • expr THEN expr ELSE expr

    IF  shift, and go to state 1
    ID  shift, and go to state 2

    expr  go to state 4


State 2

    1 expr: ID •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (expr)


State 3

    0 $accept: expr • $end
    2 expr: expr • `+` ID

    $end   shift, and go to state 5
    `+`  shift, and go to state 6


