State 9

    2 expr: expr • `+` ID
    3      | IF expr THEN expr •
    4      | IF expr THEN expr • ELSE expr

    ELSE  shift, and go to state 10
    `+`  shift, and go to state 6

    ELSE     [reduce using rule 3 (expr)]
    `+`     [reduce using rule 3 (expr)]
    $default  reduce using rule 3 (expr)

    shift/reduce conflict on token `+`:
        3 expr: IF expr THEN expr •
        2 expr: expr • `+` ID
      Example: IF expr THEN expr • `+` ID
      Shift derivation
        expr
        ↳ 3: IF expr THEN expr
                               ↳ 2: expr • `+` ID
      Reduce derivation
        expr
        ↳ 2: expr                          `+` ID
             ↳ 3: IF expr THEN expr •

    shift/reduce conflict on token ELSE:
        3 expr: IF expr THEN expr •
        4 expr: IF expr THEN expr • ELSE expr
      Example: IF expr THEN IF expr THEN expr • ELSE expr
      Shift derivation
        expr
        ↳ 3: IF expr THEN expr
                               ↳ 4: IF expr THEN expr • ELSE expr
      Reduce derivation
        expr
        ↳ 4: IF expr THEN expr                          ELSE expr
                               ↳ 3: IF expr THEN expr •



State 10

